{"seq":1,"slug":"photoelectric-effect","title":"光电效应：光量子假说的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/core-contributions/quantum-and-statistical-physics/photoelectric-effect","wordCount":1322,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"光电效应-光量子假说的诞生\">光电效应：光量子假说的诞生</h1><p>1905 年 3 月 17 日，《物理年鉴》收到爱因斯坦&quot;奇迹年&quot;的第一篇论文，标题是《关于光的产生和转化的一个启发性观点》（Über einen die Erzeugung und Verwandlung des Lichtes betreffenden heuristischen Gesichtspunkt）。爱因斯坦自己后来说，这是他唯一一篇真正&quot;革命性&quot;的论文。它提出的光量子假说，比相对论更早地撕开了经典物理的裂口，也是他日后赢得诺贝尔奖的直接原因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>光电效应是指：当光照射到金属表面时，会有电子被打出。十九世纪末的实验揭示了几个用波动光学无法解释的&quot;反常&quot;现象：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>是否有电子逸出，取决于光的<strong>频率</strong>而非强度；存在一个截止频率，低于它再强的光也打不出电子。</li>\n<li>逸出电子的最大动能只与光的频率有关，与光强无关。</li>\n<li>增大光强只增加逸出电子的<strong>数量</strong>，不增加单个电子的能量。</li>\n<li>光电效应几乎是瞬时发生的，没有可观测的延迟。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>按经典波动理论，光能均匀地散布在波前上，电子需要时间逐渐积累能量，且足够强的光迟早能打出电子——这与实验完全相悖。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[入射光 频率 ν] --&gt; B{hν 与逸出功 W 比较}&#10;    B --&gt;|hν &lt; W| C[无电子逸出]&#10;    B --&gt;|hν &gt; W| D[电子逸出]&#10;    D --&gt; E[最大动能 Ek = hν - W]\">graph LR\n    A[入射光 频率 ν] --&gt; B{hν 与逸出功 W 比较}\n    B --&gt;|hν &lt; W| C[无电子逸出]\n    B --&gt;|hν &gt; W| D[电子逸出]\n    D --&gt; E[最大动能 Ek = hν - W]</pre><p>下表对照经典预期与实验事实：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>现象</th>\n<th>经典波动理论预期</th>\n<th>实验观测</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>决定能否逸出</td>\n<td>光强</td>\n<td>光的频率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电子动能</td>\n<td>随光强增大</td>\n<td>只随频率增大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>截止频率</td>\n<td>不存在</td>\n<td>存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应时间</td>\n<td>有延迟</td>\n<td>几乎瞬时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"爱因斯坦的光量子假说\">爱因斯坦的光量子假说</h2><p>爱因斯坦的解法极为大胆：他借用普朗克（Max Planck）1900 年为黑体辐射引入的能量量子概念，但走得更远。普朗克只认为能量在发射和吸收时是量子化的；爱因斯坦则主张，<strong>光本身就是由一份份离散的能量子组成的</strong>，每一份的能量为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = h\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 是普朗克常数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 是光的频率。一个光量子（后来称光子）把全部能量一次性交给一个电子，电子要逸出金属须先克服逸出功 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>，剩下的成为动能。于是有著名的光电方程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_k = h\\nu - W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个方程精确解释了全部&quot;反常&quot;：截止频率对应 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h\\nu = W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>；动能随频率线性增加而与光强无关；光强只决定光子数目，从而决定逸出电子的数目。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实验验证与诺贝尔奖\">实验验证与诺贝尔奖</h2><p>光量子假说在提出之初遭到普遍怀疑，连普朗克本人都不接受光本身的量子化。决定性的检验来自美国物理学家密立根（Robert Millikan）。密立根原本想推翻爱因斯坦的理论，却在 1914—1916 年间用极其精密的实验反而证实了光电方程，并由此测出了普朗克常数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 的精确值。</p>\n<p>凭借对光电效应的解释，爱因斯坦获得 1921 年诺贝尔物理学奖（实际于 1922 年颁发）。值得注意的是，颁奖词刻意回避了仍有争议的相对论，只表彰光电效应——这从侧面反映了当时物理学界的态度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对量子力学的深远影响\">对量子力学的深远影响</h2><p>光电效应的意义远超一个具体现象的解释，它是整个量子革命的关键一步：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>波粒二象性的开端</strong>：光既表现出波动性（干涉、衍射），又表现出粒子性（光电效应、康普顿散射），这种双重性质后来被德布罗意（Louis de Broglie）推广到所有物质粒子。</li>\n<li><strong>光子概念的确立</strong>：1923 年康普顿（Arthur Compton）的 X 射线散射实验进一步证实光子携带动量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = h\\nu/c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，&quot;光子&quot;作为真实粒子被接受。</li>\n<li><strong>现代技术基础</strong>：光电效应是太阳能电池、光电倍增管、数码相机感光元件（CCD/CMOS）等大量现代器件的物理原理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>光电效应中电子能否逸出取决于光的频率而非强度，经典波动理论对此无能为力。</li>\n<li>爱因斯坦提出光由能量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E = h\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 的量子组成，光电方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>k</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_k = h\\nu - W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 完美解释全部实验。</li>\n<li>密立根的精密实验（1914—1916）证实了该方程，爱因斯坦因此获 1921 年诺贝尔物理学奖。</li>\n<li>光量子假说开启了波粒二象性与光子概念，是量子力学诞生的奠基性一步。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"bose-einstein-statistics\">玻色–爱因斯坦统计</a>（同章兄弟篇）——光量子作为不可区分玻色子，正是玻色重新计数黑体辐射的对象。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../legacy-and-influence/cosmology-and-unified-field\">宇宙学常数与统一场论</a>（同 hub 兄弟篇）——光量子假说开启的波粒二象性，最终引向爱因斯坦与玻尔关于量子力学完备性的长期论战（EPR）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../../hubs/cs-fundamentals/quantum-computing/quantum-foundations/qubit-and-superposition\">量子比特与叠加</a>（其它 hub）——光量子开启的量子化思想如何延伸为今日量子计算的基本单元。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../../../../hubs/chemistry/physical-chemistry/quantum-chemistry/schrodinger-equation\">薛定谔方程</a>（其它 hub）——光电效应揭示的能量量子化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>ν</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E=h\\nu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span></span></span></span></span> 是量子力学波动方程的历史前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"光电效应：光量子假说的诞生","id":"光电效应-光量子假说的诞生"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"爱因斯坦的光量子假说","id":"爱因斯坦的光量子假说"},{"level":2,"text":"实验验证与诺贝尔奖","id":"实验验证与诺贝尔奖"},{"level":2,"text":"对量子力学的深远影响","id":"对量子力学的深远影响"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"广义相对论：引力即时空弯曲","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/core-contributions/relativity-theory/general-relativity"},"next":{"title":"布朗运动：原子真实存在的证明","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/albert-einstein/core-contributions/quantum-and-statistical-physics/brownian-motion"}}